@startuml Signal Processing Pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F0F0F0
skinparam activityBorderColor #555555

title Signal Processing Pipeline\n[Cl. 1, 7, 29, 33 — acquire → process → control signal]

|#LightBlue|Input|
start
:BioSample
(rrInterval: ms, timestamp: ContinuousClock.Instant)
——
Device adapter creates one per heartbeat;
note right
  **[Cl. 5, 16, 31, 42]**
  "physiologic data acquisition"
  — heart rate signal
end note

|#LightYellow|Filtering|
:RRBuffer<MedianMalikFilter>
——
1. Range gate: 300–2000 ms (30–200 BPM)
2. Ectopic filter: |rr − median(last 5)| / median < 20%
——
Output: cleaned BioSample or nil (rejected);

:StreamingCoherenceEngine
appends to 60-second rolling buffer (FIFO);

|#LightCoral|Time Domain|
:HRVMetrics
——
• rmssd (ms)
• sdnn (ms)
• pnn50 (proportion)
• meanRR (ms);

|#LightCoral|Frequency Domain|
:FrequencyDomainMetrics
——
• Resample → 4 Hz uniform grid
• Mean removal / detrend
• Hann windowing
• FFT → PSD
• Band integration:
    VLF: 0.003–0.04 Hz
    LF:  0.04–0.15 Hz
    HF:  0.15–0.40 Hz
• lfHfRatio, lfNormalized;

|#Wheat|Scoring|
:CoherenceAlgorithm.score()
——
1. Find peak in PSD [0.04–0.26 Hz]
2. Integrate power around peak (±0.015 Hz)
3. Integrate total band power
4. ratio = peak_power / band_power
5. coherence = clamp(ratio × 100, 0, 100)
6. breathingRate = peakFreq × 60 BPM;
note right
  **[Cl. 7, 18, 33, 44]**
  "analysis of physiologic data
  to determine increase/decrease"
end note

|#Wheat|Smoothing|
:EMA Smoothing
——
smoothed = α × raw + (1 − α) × prev
α default = 0.3 (user-adjustable)
——
Warmup gate: no output until ≥ 30s data;
note right
  **[Cl. 10, 11, 36, 37]**
  Fixed + adaptive threshold
end note

|#LightGreen|Output|
:CoherenceResult
——
coherence, breathingRate, peakFrequency,
rmssd, lfPower, hfPower, lfHfRatio;

:FeedbackUpdate;
note right
  **[Cl. 6, 17, 32, 43]**
  Control signal → reward/penalty
  per training protocol
end note
stop

@enduml
